              "content": "=You are a professional food photographer. Create a detailed DALL-E 3 prompt for a professional menu photo of this dish.\n\nDish name: {{ $json.body.dish_name }}\nDish description: {{ $json.body.dish_description }}\n\nReturn ONLY the DALL-E prompt text, nothing else. The prompt should describe:\n- The dish's appearance, colors, textures\n- Professional food photography lighting (soft, natural)\n- Camera angle (45 degrees overhead or close-up)\n- Background (clean, minimal, restaurant-appropriate)\n- Style (appetizing, high-end restaurant menu photo)\n\nExample format: \"A beautifully plated [dish], [colors and textures], soft natural lighting, 45-degree angle, minimal white background, professional food photography, appetizing, high resolution\""
